{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Seed Messages 快速开始",
    "description": "快速上手 Seed 系列模型的 Messages 接口（Anthropic 兼容格式），5 分钟完成第一次对话调用",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://direct.evolink.ai",
      "description": "生产环境（推荐）"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "备用地址"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/messages": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Seed Messages 快速对话",
        "description": "- 使用 Anthropic Messages 格式调用 Seed 系列模型，可直接用于 Claude Code 等兼容 Anthropic 协议的工具\n- 同步处理模式，实时返回对话内容\n- 最简化参数，快速上手\n- 支持模型：`doubao-seed-2-1-pro`、`doubao-seed-2-1-turbo`、`doubao-seed-2-1-lite`、`doubao-seed-evolving`、`doubao-seed-2.0-pro`、`doubao-seed-2.0-lite`、`doubao-seed-2.0-mini`、`doubao-seed-2.0-code`\n- **Seed 2.0 旧模型名**：`doubao-seed-2.0-pro` / `doubao-seed-2.0-lite` 现已重定向到 `doubao-seed-2-1-lite`，`doubao-seed-2.0-code` 现已重定向到 `doubao-seed-evolving`，参数行为以新模型为准；新接入建议直接使用新模型名。`doubao-seed-2.0-mini` 不受影响\n- 需要更多功能？查看 [完整参数文档](/cn/api-manual/language-series/doubao-seed-2.0/doubao-seed-2.0-messages-reference)",
        "operationId": "createMessageQuickSeed",
        "tags": [
          "Messages"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageQuickRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "对话生成成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 400,
                    "message": "Invalid request parameters",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未认证、Token无效或过期",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 401,
                    "message": "Invalid or expired token",
                    "type": "authentication_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "配额不足、需要充值",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 402,
                    "message": "Insufficient quota",
                    "type": "insufficient_quota_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "https://evolink.ai/dashboard/credits"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "无权限访问",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 403,
                    "message": "Access denied for this model",
                    "type": "permission_error",
                    "param": "model"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "资源不存在",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 404,
                    "message": "Specified model not found",
                    "type": "not_found_error",
                    "param": "model",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "请求频率超限",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 429,
                    "message": "Rate limit exceeded",
                    "type": "rate_limit_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "retry after 60 seconds"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "服务器内部错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 500,
                    "message": "Internal server error",
                    "type": "internal_server_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "try again later"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "模型服务暂时异常",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 502,
                    "message": "Upstream AI service unavailable",
                    "type": "upstream_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "try different model"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "服务暂时不可用",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 503,
                    "message": "Service temporarily unavailable",
                    "type": "service_unavailable_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "retry after 30 seconds"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "MessageQuickRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "max_tokens",
          "messages"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "要调用的模型\n\n| 模型 ID | 定位 | 上下文 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `doubao-seed-2-1-pro` | Seed 2.1 旗舰档，适合复杂推理、长文档与代码库任务（推荐） | 100 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-2-1-turbo` | Seed 2.1 低价档，覆盖大多数对话、抽取与 Agent 任务 | 25.6 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-2-1-lite` | Seed 2.1 单价最低的一档。音频输入仅限 Chat Completions 和 Responses | 100 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-evolving` | 按周更新的 Seed 模型，适合评估新能力 | 100 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-pro` | 旧模型名，现已重定向到 `doubao-seed-2-1-lite` | 100 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-lite` | 旧模型名，现已重定向到 `doubao-seed-2-1-lite` | 100 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-mini` | Seed 2.0 极速版，适合简单任务 | 25.6 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-code` | 旧模型名，现已重定向到 `doubao-seed-evolving` | 100 万 Token |\n\n注意两代模型 ID 的写法不同：Seed 2.1 写作 `2-1`（连字符），Seed 2.0 写作 `2.0`（点号）。",
            "enum": [
              "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
              "doubao-seed-2-1-turbo",
              "doubao-seed-2-1-lite",
              "doubao-seed-evolving",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-pro",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-lite",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-mini",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-code"
            ],
            "default": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
            "example": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro"
          },
          "max_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "example": 4096,
            "description": "本次生成允许输出的最大 token 数，包含思考内容与正文。\n\n开启思考时请预留足够预算（建议不低于 1024）；预算耗尽时 `stop_reason` 为 `max_tokens`，可能只有思考内容、没有正文"
          },
          "messages": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "description": "对话消息列表",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageSimple"
            },
            "example": [
              {
                "role": "user",
                "content": "你好，请用三句话介绍一下你自己"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "MessageSimple": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "role",
          "content"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "user"
            ],
            "description": "消息角色"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "消息内容（纯文本）"
          }
        }
      },
      "MessageResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "响应的唯一标识",
            "example": "0217952345678901234567890abcdef"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "message"
            ],
            "description": "对象类型，固定为 message"
          },
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "assistant"
            ],
            "description": "固定为 assistant"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "本次请求使用的模型",
            "example": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "模型生成的内容块。开启思考时通常先返回 `thinking` 块，再返回 `text` 块；读取正文请遍历 `type=\"text\"` 的块",
            "items": {
              "oneOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TextBlock"
                },
                {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ThinkingBlock"
                }
              ]
            },
            "example": [
              {
                "type": "thinking",
                "thinking": "用户想要一句简短的自我介绍……",
                "signature": "EqQBCkgIARABGAIi..."
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "你好！我是 Seed 系列大语言模型，擅长推理、写作和代码。"
              }
            ]
          },
          "stop_reason": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "停止原因\n\n- `end_turn`: 正常结束\n- `max_tokens`: 达到 max_tokens 上限\n- `stop_sequence`: 命中停止序列\n- `tool_use`: 模型请求调用函数",
            "enum": [
              "end_turn",
              "max_tokens",
              "stop_sequence",
              "tool_use"
            ],
            "example": "end_turn"
          },
          "stop_sequence": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "命中的停止序列，未命中时为 null"
          },
          "usage": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageUsage"
          }
        }
      },
      "TextBlock": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "文本",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "text"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "text"
            ],
            "description": "内容块类型，固定为 text"
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "文本内容"
          }
        }
      },
      "ThinkingBlock": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "思考",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "thinking"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "thinking"
            ],
            "description": "内容块类型，固定为 thinking"
          },
          "thinking": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "模型的思考内容。多轮对话时与 signature 一起原样回传"
          },
          "signature": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "思考内容的签名。多轮对话时必须与 thinking 一起原样回传，保持内容块顺序不变"
          }
        }
      },
      "MessageUsage": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Token 使用统计信息",
        "properties": {
          "input_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "未命中缓存的输入 token 数量（不含 `cache_read_input_tokens`）",
            "example": 25
          },
          "cache_read_input_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "命中缓存的输入 token 数量，按缓存命中价计费。完整输入 = `input_tokens` + `cache_read_input_tokens`",
            "example": 0
          },
          "cache_creation_input_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "固定返回 0，本接口不单独收取缓存写入费",
            "example": 0
          },
          "output_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "输出 token 数量，包含思考内容",
            "example": 120
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "HTTP状态错误代码"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误描述信息"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误类型"
              },
              "param": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "相关参数名称"
              },
              "fallback_suggestion": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误时的建议"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "##所有接口均需要使用Bearer Token进行认证##\n\n**获取 API Key：**\n\n访问 [API Key 管理页面](https://evolink.ai/dashboard/keys) 获取您的 API Key\n\n**使用时在请求头中添加：**\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```"
      }
    }
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Messages",
      "description": "Anthropic Messages 兼容接口"
    }
  ]
}
